    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're learning Japanese, Spanish, or more, level up your language skills and magic! Ride the stars in a fast-paced rhythm game or spell the words letter by letter as the clock ticks by. New mini-games are on the way, bringing fresh challenges, new spells, and even more fun ways to practice. The magical classroom is always growing! Stay tuned for exciting updates!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize your experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Import your own decks to tailor your learning experience!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify the speed of the song to make rhythm mini-games easier!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add your own songs to study to!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3685020/extras/3c9720242088ced880211463e4ff25b1.avif?t=1749575022\" data-has-big width=800 height=900 /></span></p>",
